# Density Compare
# Arsenic (As) — real density 5.727 g/cm³. equal masses: Arsenic vs water — sides ∝ (1/ρ)^(1/3).
scene "Arsenic Density Compare"

element_cube = cube 11.2mm color: #bd80e3 at (-20mm, 5.6mm, 0)
water_cube = cube 20mm material: water at (18mm, 10mm, 0)
# both cubes weigh the same: about 45.7 g — the water cube is the reference
